    "body": "fix on issue/3675-prebuild-wedge · PR #3738 · pinned by watchdog_tests::a_recording_build_ends_when_cargo_exits_not_when_its_descendants_do · merges when reviewed\n\nNote: the reported wedge did not occur on this machine (cargo 1.100.0, the shared sccache server already ran). The fix removes the one wait of the prebuild path that depends on the sccache server: cargo's JSON went through a pipe, and a long-lived descendant (the sccache server) kept that pipe open after cargo exited. No watchdog runs during that wait. The PR body gives the readings. If the wedge occurs again with this fix, reopen this issue.",
